### 1.5 EDS Block Fixes 

Both accordion.js and card.js had incorrect function names:

// ❌ Wrong — EDS cannot call this
export default function init(el) { ... }

// ✅ Correct — EDS always calls decorate
export default function decorate(block) { ... }
Rule: EDS block loader always calls export default function decorate(block). 

