## Key Learnings

- **EDS block functions must be named decorate — not init or anything else
- **UDEX core tokens use --sap... prefix — not --udex... for fonts and headings
- **Font name is "72 Brand Variable" — not "SAP72"
- **CDN latest path auto-updates token VALUES — but not token NAMES
- **CSP must explicitly allow cdn.udex.services.sap.com for fonts and styles
- **Branch-specific preview URLs — https://<branch>--<repo>--<org>.aem.page
- **DA config sheet tab must be named exactly config (lowercase)
- **Fragments must be previewed and published before pages that depend on them
- **DA org-level config ≠ site-level config — collaborator access goes in .da/config
- **Config sheets don't need preview — saving is sufficient
- **UDEX spacer token number = pixel value — --udexSpacer4 = 4px not 1rem
- **Header/footer guard must check <meta> tags — not .metadata block divs
- **Block name in HTML must exactly match folder/file name
- **DA .da folder is hidden in file browser but accessible via direct URL